---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Meet Luna Jerney, founder of Birky Studio. I help real estate agents and small business owners save time with digital employees and professional websites." image="/images/birky-logo.jpg">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section style="padding:100px 0 80px;position:relative;overflow:hidden">
    <div style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% 50%,rgba(255,45,149,0.15),transparent 50%),radial-gradient(circle at 80% 50%,rgba(255,45,149,0.1),transparent 50%);"></div>
    <div class="container" style="position:relative;z-index:1;text-align:center;">
      <div style="width:150px;height:150px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;border:4px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);margin:0 auto 24px;box-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(255,45,149,0.3);">
        <img src="/images/luna-about.jpg" alt="Luna Jerney, founder of Birky Studio" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;">
      </div>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem);font-weight:800;color:white;margin-bottom:20px;text-transform:uppercase;">
        Hi, I'm <span style="color:var(--bs-accent);">Luna Jerney</span>
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--bs-text);max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.8;">
        Five years ago I landed in Antigua Guatemala with two suitcases and a life I left behind in the Netherlands. I had never been here before. Today I run Birky Studio from a mountain town above the city, and I built it around the one thing I never want to run out of: time.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size:1.02rem;color:var(--bs-text-muted);max-width:680px;margin:18px auto 0;line-height:1.7;">
        I help real estate agents and small business owners figure out where automation can actually save them time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Content -->
  <section style="padding:80px 0">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width:750px;margin:0 auto;">

        <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;color:white;margin-bottom:24px;">Why I Do This</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          Most business owners are throwing time and money at tech without any real plan. They buy tools they don't use, hire people they don't need, and still end up overwhelmed. I come in, diagnose what's actually worth automating, and build it for them, fast.
        </p>
        <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:32px;">
          Whether it is a digital employee that catches every lead and never sleeps, a bilingual website, or a receptionist that works 24/7. I build solutions that actually save you time. Not just tech for the sake of tech.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;color:white;margin-bottom:24px;">How I Got Here</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          I'm a real estate agent and the owner of <a href="https://antiguarealestatedevelopment.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--bs-accent);">Antigua Real Estate Development (ARD)</a>, a bilingual agency helping expats and locals buy, sell, and rent property in Antigua Guatemala. I know the real estate business from the inside because I live it every day.
        </p>
        <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">
          I built my first website for ARD in 2024. Clients saw it and started asking me to build theirs too. Then they asked if I could automate their follow-ups, their emails, their lead responses. So I learned how, and Birky Studio was born.
        </p>
        <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:32px;">
          I'm not a big agency with a sales team and 30-day onboarding. I'm a one-person studio who builds what other business owners actually need, because I face the same challenges. I answer when you call and deliver in days, not months.
        </p>

        <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;color:white;margin-bottom:24px;">What I Do</h2>
        <div style="display:grid;gap:24px;margin-bottom:32px;">
          <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:16px;padding:28px;">
            <h3 style="color:var(--bs-accent);font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:8px;">The Base Agent</h3>
            <p style="color:white;line-height:1.7;">A digital employee that runs on its own always-on server, with a Notion CRM, lead capture and automatic follow-up. Trained on your business, your processes, your clients.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:16px;padding:28px;">
            <h3 style="color:var(--bs-accent);font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:8px;">Website Design</h3>
            <p style="color:white;line-height:1.7;">Professional, bilingual (EN/ES) websites that load fast and look great on mobile. Built with Astro, deployed in 3 days. No page builders, no bloated code.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);border-radius:16px;padding:28px;">
            <h3 style="color:var(--bs-accent);font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:8px;">Voice &amp; Text Receptionist</h3>
            <p style="color:white;line-height:1.7;">A receptionist that answers calls and WhatsApp messages 24/7. Qualifies leads, books appointments, and transfers urgent calls, for a fraction of a human hire.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 style="font-size:1.6rem;color:white;margin-bottom:24px;">Why Work With Me?</h2>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-bottom:40px;">
          <div style="background:rgba(255,45,149,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,45,149,0.22);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;text-align:center;">
            <div style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--bs-accent);">2-3</div>
            <div style="color:white;font-size:0.9rem;">Days to deliver</div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:rgba(255,45,149,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,45,149,0.22);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;text-align:center;">
            <div style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--bs-accent);">EN/ES</div>
            <div style="color:white;font-size:0.9rem;">Bilingual ready</div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:rgba(255,45,149,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,45,149,0.22);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;text-align:center;">
            <div style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--bs-accent);">1</div>
            <div style="color:white;font-size:0.9rem;">Person, not a call center</div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:rgba(255,45,149,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,45,149,0.22);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;text-align:center;">
            <div style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--bs-accent);">★★★★★</div>
            <div style="color:white;font-size:0.9rem;"><a href="https://maps.google.com/maps?cid=3736652178913824182" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:white;text-decoration:underline;">A 5-star review</a> from a happy client</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border-left:4px solid var(--bs-accent);border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:40px;">
          <p style="color:white;line-height:1.7;font-style:italic;margin-bottom:8px;">"Professional, fast, and it actually works. Luna solved my problem faster than I expected and was a pleasure to deal with."</p>
          <div style="color:var(--bs-text-muted);font-size:0.9rem;">— Suzi, a happy Birky Studio client</div>
        </div>

        <div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--bs-bg-raised),var(--bs-bg-raised));border-radius:16px;padding:40px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,45,149,0.3);">
          <h2 style="color:white;font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:16px;">Ready to Save Time?</h2>
          <p style="color:var(--bs-text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:24px;max-width:500px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">
            Tell me about your business and I'll tell you what's worth automating. Free, no obligation.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-white" style="font-size:1.1rem;padding:16px 36px;">
            Start Your Project →
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>